================================================================================
1. mattpocock/skills
================================================================================

Source:  https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
Author:  Matt Pocock

The following skills in plugins/builder-tools/skills/ derive from this project.
Upstream paths are relative to that repository's skills/ directory.

  Taken verbatim
  --------------
  codebase-design                <- engineering/codebase-design
  domain-modeling                <- engineering/domain-modeling
  grill-with-docs                <- engineering/grill-with-docs
  grilling                       <- productivity/grilling
  improve-codebase-architecture  <- engineering/improve-codebase-architecture
  prototype                      <- engineering/prototype
  research                       <- engineering/research
  resolving-merge-conflicts      <- engineering/resolving-merge-conflicts

  Modified
  --------
  implement                      <- engineering/implement
  review-changes                 <- engineering/code-review
  setup-builder-tools            <- engineering/setup-matt-pocock-skills
  tdd                            <- engineering/tdd
  to-spec                        <- engineering/to-spec
  to-tickets                     <- engineering/to-tickets
  triage                         <- engineering/triage
  wayfinder                      <- engineering/wayfinder

Modifications are limited to renaming two skills and retargeting the references
that point at them, removing GitLab issue-tracker support, and rebranding
identifiers that named the upstream project. See each SKILL.md's
`metadata.local_changes` for the specifics.

